"font-weight:600;\">Personal Invitation</span></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; "
"margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Give the information "
"below to the person that you want to invite (<a href=\"htc\">how to connect<"
